# blocker: compound hint

laws boolean

theorem ex7d: if b∨c then P else Q fi = if b then P else if c then P else Q fi fi
    if b then P else if c then P else Q fi fi    case analysis twice
=   b∧P ∨ ¬b∧(c∧P ∨ ¬c∧Q)          distribute
=   b∧P ∨ ¬b∧c∧P ∨ ¬b∧¬c∧Q         factor
=   (b ∨ ¬b∧c)∧P ∨ ¬b∧¬c∧Q         distribute, duality
=   (b ∨ ¬b)∧(b ∨ c)∧P ∨ ¬(b ∨ c)∧Q    excluded middle and identity
=   (b ∨ c)∧P ∨ ¬(b ∨ c)∧Q         case analysis
=   if b∨c then P else Q fi
